  (text "Allocation: accepted 100-pad CSV. No GPIO reassignment.\nADC_ labels are scaled physical inputs, never raw battery rails.\nVCAP pins share their own node; never tied to 3.3 V.\nVBAT is the backup-domain pin, supplied by this MCU domain.\nSWD and oscillator nets are distinct for each processor."
    (at 248.92 68.58 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "90718d64-897c-5f26-934f-91d76188c6ca"))
  (text "Support, clock, reset and probe circuitry on the next sheet.\nGlobal labels connect sheets; named *_ISO nets are separate\nconductors on opposite sides of a powered-off-safe boundary.\nFirmware and hardware qualification remain with the team."
    (at 248.92 109.22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "bf131fc6-6911-5e24-abc7-aaea35fcde0d"))
